    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1751780360\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TSG DH ModLoader is a community-driven mod for Dread Hunger, which makes it possible to play mods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM expands the boundaries of your Dread Hunger adventure with new content to be discovered, and it's all created by the Dread Hunger community! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM allows players to play mods, and is designed to let you play alone, with friends - one or many mods, whatever you want!\u00a0(The mods is already built into the app)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Survive the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fires to keep warm, fight off wolves and other predators, and hunt for food to survive the unforgiving Canadian Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Betray other players</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them contaminated food, lure animals to attack them, curse them with blood magic, and if all else fails... shoot them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- You are what you eat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arctic, you'll need to make tough choices to stay fed. Butcher carcasses and use the remains as weapons - or as food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Become a Captain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a 19th century warship around (or into) icebergs. Find coal for your boilers that constantly need fuel to keep the ship moving... or explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Brave the perils of the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your time around the full day and night cycle, adapt to unexpected whiteouts, and try to survive the massive blizzard that looms over your expedition.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774340/extras/9c1261bbbc12dcd24df3006f8f95f935.avif?t=1751780360\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TSG DH ModLoader is a community-driven mod for Dread Hunger, which makes it possible to play mods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM expands the boundaries of your Dread Hunger adventure with new content to be discovered, and it's all created by the Dread Hunger community! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TDM allows players to play mods, and is designed to let you play alone, with friends - one or many mods, whatever you want!\u00a0(The mods is already built into the app)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Survive the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fires to keep warm, fight off wolves and other predators, and hunt for food to survive the unforgiving Canadian Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Betray other players</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them contaminated food, lure animals to attack them, curse them with blood magic, and if all else fails... shoot them in the back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- You are what you eat</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arctic, you'll need to make tough choices to stay fed. Butcher carcasses and use the remains as weapons - or as food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Become a Captain</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail a 19th century warship around (or into) icebergs. Find coal for your boilers that constantly need fuel to keep the ship moving... or explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>- Brave the perils of the Arctic</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your time around the full day and night cycle, adapt to unexpected whiteouts, and try to survive the massive blizzard that looms over your expedition.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a game about survival and betrayal. Using the mod loader made by TSG Team, 8 to 12 explorers will sail through the harsh Arctic on a ship. Among the crew, there is a traitor who has summoned dark forces to frame the other explorers.",
